& [ImplementedMeaning] is inspectable
  + all seven faculties have stable enum identities
  + Honesty guards semantic and epistemic IdentityBoundary records
  + Security guards authority, scope, resource, disclosure, mutation, and effect IdentityBoundary records
  + Honesty and Security must each form boundaries before projection and gate the refined candidate afterward
  + Weaver emits relational CombinatoryProjection records
  + Planner emits temporal CombinatoryProjection records
  + projections remain potential and never encode selection, admission, authorization, execution, or inscription
  + Refiner is required before final gates
  + Observer observes before specialist work and decides before inscription
  + Scribe anchors before transformation and inscribes last
  + every activation has exactly one faculty-matched return
  + every faculty is activated or explicitly omitted, with Planner and Weaver omissions limited to preservation cycles

& [Validation] is fail closed
  + duplicate identity or ordinal rejects
  + non-monotonic stage storage rejects
  + silent faculty omission rejects
  + activation and omission collision rejects
  + missing or mismatched returns reject
  + incorrect stage order rejects
  + missing or incorrectly guarded identity boundaries reject
  + uncited identity boundaries reject
  + missing, mismatched, or uncited combinatory projections reject
  + unknown serialized fields reject

& [DeliberateLimit] is retained
  + the module records and validates faculty-cycle structure but does not run a faculty
  + the module does not attach FacultyCycle to SemanticTransition
  + the module does not load prompts, invoke providers, persist records, query the fabric, or commit effects
